### Test Reorder Endpoint
### This tests the new reorder functionality for quotes
### 
### USAGE: This file requires an HTTP client environment file (http-client.env.json) with:
### {
###   "dev": {
###     "baseUrl": "http://localhost:8080",
###     "authToken": "your-jwt-token-here"
###   }
### }
### Or you can replace {{baseUrl}} with your actual server URL and {{authToken}} with a valid JWT token

### 1. Login to get JWT token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loginIdentifier": "testuser",
  "password": "testpassword"
}

> {%
    const responseBody = JSON.parse(response.body);
    client.global.set("authToken", responseBody.token);
%}

### 2. Like some quotes first (to have quotes to reorder)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quote/1/like
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quote/2/like
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quote/3/like
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 3. Get liked quotes to see current order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quote/liked
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Reorder quote ID 3 to position 1 (using newPosition)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quote/3/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPosition": 1
}

### 5. Get liked quotes again to verify reordering
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quote/liked
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Reorder quote ID 1 to position 3 (using Order field)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quote/1/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Order": 3
}

### 7. Get liked quotes again to verify second reordering
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quote/liked
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Test error cases

### 8a. Try to reorder a quote that wasn't liked
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quote/99/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPosition": 1
}

### 8b. Try to reorder with invalid position
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quote/1/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPosition": 0
}

### 8c. Try to reorder without authentication
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quote/1/reorder
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPosition": 1
}
